# What not to ship.
#
# assets/gen/ holds the generation masters — the full-size PNGs Higgsfield
# returned, plus the shell scripts that made them and the node script that
# builds the changelog. 51MB of the 54MB in this directory, and the site never
# asks for any of it: everything served comes from assets/img/, which is the
# same art through ffmpeg's libwebp encoder at 836KB the lot. The one mention
# of `assets/gen` in src/ is a comment in panel.js saying where the changelog
# came from.
#
# They are gitignored too, so this is belt and braces — the CLI uploads from
# disk, not from the index, and would have shipped all 51MB.
assets/gen/

# Never referenced. Grepped index.html and styles.css: the faces actually
# loaded are Geist, GeistMono and Cinzel.
assets/fonts/Inter-Variable.ttf

# Local Vercel state and the OIDC token it writes.
.vercel
.env*
